ack entrances.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi"},{"lap":0,"text":"The first category started ahead of the second with an interval of two minutes.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi"},{"lap":0,"text":"At 10 a.m. the 12 cars of the first category, arranged in 4 rows, started simultaneously. The rain was very heavy.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi"},{"lap":0,"text":"Maserati's red Diatto shot ahead from the second row, passed very quickly and took the lead","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":2},{"lap":0,"text":"Meregalli retires at the start with a breakdown.","q":false,"c":21},{"lap":1,"text":"Maserati followed by Scales passed in front of the stands completing the first lap.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":2},{"lap":2,"text":"Brilli-Peri passed Dubonnet on the second lap","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":17},{"lap":7,"text":"Halfway through the 7th lap Ascari stopped to change a tire in about 35 seconds.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":11},{"lap":7,"text":"Caiselli stopped his Indy Packard to change two spark plugs.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":8},{"lap":8,"text":"Niccolini's large Fiat which made a double spin around itself without any consequences.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":4},{"lap":9,"text":"Maserati continued to increase his advantage.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":2},{"lap":10,"text":"Campari laps in 4m14.2s at 141.620 km/h.","q":false,"c":14},{"lap":12,"text":"On the 12th lap, when Brilli-Peri had a 40 second advantage over Dubonnet, he experienced valve failure which caused a backfire, setting the engine alight.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":17},{"lap":12,"text":"Brilli-Peri retires, his mechanic burned; Dubonnet leads the big class from Franz Conelli.","q":false,"c":0},{"lap":13,"text":"On the 13th lap Sivocci went off the road in a turn without damaging the car and was able to continue.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":3},{"lap":15,"text":"Caberto Conelli spun off in a turn and retired after completing 14 laps","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":16},{"lap":19,"text":"Ceirano stops for good on the circuit.","q":false,"c":15},{"lap":20,"text":"Besides his tire failures a balance wheel broke on the 20th lap and he retired after completing 19 laps in 1h28m59.2s.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":14},{"lap":20,"text":"In the middle of lap 20 Maserati stopped for about 6 minutes to change a tire, refuel and top up oil and Water.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":2},{"lap":20,"text":"His lap time of 10m56.8s was enough to lose first place to Sivocci.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":3},{"lap":21,"text":"Costantini stopped for 5 minutes to refuel almost at the same time as Mario Galleani in the Mercedes made his pit stop.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":5},{"lap":22,"text":"Silvani, running third, retires on the circuit with a failed oil tank.","q":false,"c":13},{"lap":30,"text":"Maserati laps in 4m15.8s, fastest in his category so far.","q":false,"c":2},{"lap":32,"text":"He took the lead at the end of the 32nd lap after 2h38m30s only 10 seconds ahead of Sivocci. Maserati then stopped for a second time to refuel for about 40 seconds.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":2},{"lap":32,"text":"Cattaneo retired his Ceirano along the circuit during the 32nd lap.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":12},{"lap":35,"text":"Ascari, who suffered from repeated tire trouble, managed to move to 3rd place in the overall standings at the end of lap 35, just three minutes ahead of Maserati and Sivocci.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":11},{"lap":35,"text":"But then Ascari retired due to a lubrication breakdown.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":11},{"lap":36,"text":"At the end of the 36th lap, Sivocci in the small category held first place in 2h53m31s, with a 17 second advantage.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":3},{"lap":38,"text":"Maserati passes Sivocci for the small-class lead.","q":false,"c":2},{"lap":40,"text":"On the 40th lap Dubonnet's time was 3h02m57.4s and Franz Conelli 3h05m23.4s","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":0},{"lap":40,"text":"Dubonnet, Franz Conelli, Maserati and Sivocci subsequently crossed the finish line amid the applause of the crowd.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":0}]}